      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eden_Roc%2C_Hawaii"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Eden Roc's elevation ranges from about 1,526 to 2,123 feet, giving it an undulating forested landscape.",
